# Cloudflare Pages Routing Configuration for PINTE Website
# This configuration simplifies routing by leveraging Cloudflare Pages' default behavior
# Cloudflare Pages automatically serves existing static files (including index.html in subdirectories)
# and falls back to SPA routing only for non-existent paths

# 1. Serve static assets directly - this is the default behavior of Cloudflare Pages
# No need for explicit pass-through rules as Cloudflare Pages prioritizes existing files

# 2. SPA fallback for non-existent paths
# This rule is the core of SPA routing - only matches when no static file is found
/*  /index.html  200
